The basic pla Settings in bambu studio other than the below:
Only one wall on top surface - Not applied
Top surface pattern - Concentric
Bottom surface pattern - Rectilinear
Sparse infill pattern - Gyroid
Enable supports - On
Top Z distance - .24mm
Bottom Z distance - .24mm
Base Pattern - Rectilinear

The front strut has to be paused at the top of each bearing location to insert the bearing in while printing.
The steering strut needs to be paused at the top of its bearing location to put the bearing in while printing. 


The tire are printed out of TPU 85A, I had to heavlity modify the settings, but start with the bambu studio TPU 95A settings
Line width Default - 0.45mm
Line width outer wall - .45mm
Wall loops - 5
Sparse infill density - 90%
Sparse infill pattern - Cubic
Speed intial layer - 15mm/s
Speed intial layer infill 15mm/s
Speed outer wall 20mm/s
Speed inner wall 30mm/s
Speed sparse infill 40mm/s
Speed internal solid infill 40mm/s
Speed top surface 20mm/s
Speed travel 100mm/s
Flow rate 1.5
auxillary fan 0%
